orporate carve-outs of subsidiaries and mission-critical supply divisions from multinational corporations, operational restructurings of undervalued businesses, and builds up. The firm seeks to invest in industrials, Health and Wellness, financial services, consumer, and business services & software. It invests in global businesses headquartered in North America, including United States, Canada, and Europe. The firm seeks to invest between $125 million and $1000 million in companies that have minimum revenues of $300 million. It does not consider size if the company is in an industry in which the firm already has presence. The firm seeks to make direct as well as co-investments through managed private equity, real estate, and credit funds. It seeks to acquire a control position in its portfolio companies. Onex Corporation was founded in 1984 and is based in Toronto, Canada with additional offices in New York, New York; Englewood Cliffs, New Jersey; Boston, Massachusetts and London, United Kingdom.", "sector": "Financial Services", "industry": "Asset Management"}, "valuation": {"pe": 9.606926, "pb": 0.6421293, "ps": 9.982014, "roe": 6.41, "net_margin": 68.16, "debt_to_equity": 0.314, "div_yield": 0.36, "rev_growth": -10.4, "market_cap": 8464747520.0, "forward_pe": 5.548, "peg": null, "payout": 3.5, "five_yr_yield": 0.45, "pe_sector_med": 18.344086, "pb_sector_med": 2.275652, "roe_sector_med": 12.56, "div_yield_sector_med": 2.7}, "archetype": "mixed", "archetype_label": "Mixed profile", "archetype_label_zh": "\u6df7\u5408\u7279\u5f81", "consensus": {"n_analysts": 4, "target_mean": 149.75, "target_high": 175.0, "target_low": 130.0, "rating_mean": 2.25, "rating": "Buy", "rating_zh": "\u4e70\u5165", "upside_pct": 35.0}, "positioning": {"shares_short": 629366.0, "days_to_cover": 6.91, "short_pct_float": null, "held_insiders": 14.91, "held_institutions": 39.3}}, "earnings": {"next_date": "2026-08-07", "surprises": [{"date": "2022-11-11", "eps": 2.82, "est": 1.68, "surprise